[00:30.30]Time to rearrange
[00:30.30]重整杂乱的心绪
[00:37.10]Yeah, I've been drinking less, and I've been thinking more
[00:37.10]Yeah 我已减少了贪杯 开始了深切的自省
[00:41.85]Been wanting different things
[00:41.85]渴求着迥然不同的生活
[00:45.49]That's what spring is for
